WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
father grandfather take care

2
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:14,940
Wang Teng is dead and Shengjun is gone. The Guan family is too late.

3
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:18,700
The empire I had worked so hard to build for seventy years was dismantled overnight.

4
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:22,420
Why is Wang Tengye Xuanjie not a mediocre person?

5
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,620
Why do you worship so neatly?

6
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:27,220
Fengjian rolled the wood and smashed it down.

7
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:30,250
No one is allowed to retreat. Anyone who retreats will be killed immediately.

8
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:38,490
This woman is really a human being

9
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:41,810
Even if I'm in a desperate situation, I won't panic at all

10
00:00:42,290 --> 00:00:45,010
If it had been anyone else, the capital would have been destroyed long ago.

11
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:56,580
It's a pity that she met me

12
00:00:56,780 --> 00:00:59,220
Who are you? How dare you break into the golden land?

13
00:01:38,090 --> 00:01:40,250
Coming across the sea with three volumes of heavenly books on his back
